{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5b9b7d870a9659a97652ba1269b9bf6facaaab0526cb675dea4efa05c4baa3b7",
      "source_sha256": "eabba991e14656cd200241ff136247a3cd62f5ed6c6b6929a5483742562b8895",
      "translation": "这是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9138c9ca9b78f423560a65fc710dcdecbeb3062959fdbba625efbc03a3d72a0e",
      "source_sha256": "8f15d01d81117418eef29c2f9fca8b050119cd1ef04fe8faff5ff3a215282fa3",
      "translation": "你真的是失忆了吗？这已经不是乡巴佬，简直是原始人了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3bd23abfe7db2b7e024f18def806647e485a94ade45941141eccc00d326a4b8b",
      "source_sha256": "63dfe52837e300f95d5d7ce69807addcce556242e31543f8c6c136470a87cee9",
      "translation": "别拿你的标准，去衡量所有人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d886cc173f90b6a856ce7f0917a2c1768dc8868b14764b861e9fe1eb4bd7a9cc",
      "source_sha256": "3d902488519e731b624743720ab9279850987cc4c991eda19bd31ec060ac5374",
      "translation": "想生气的话，怎么不去气气自己那连常识都不懂的笨脑袋？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e13e2fb305c8713ffb5619df7010a031a9816330b8aca5866a2b9ddb13dda95f",
      "source_sha256": "8b4b0a12850a9f6bf6b9a69f313d71d9857ae7dcab87347846b0aff6953f9533",
      "translation": "我又不是自愿失忆的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5525e377bec5c9e971c19d6cb9db3d2278aa831c3b06a5099cf12748fd4be145",
      "source_sha256": "c2f725ca8bfae31bb590a6771b2c98016661a9c04755b9ae29e78930325bde21",
      "translation": "你们两个再不住嘴，我就把你们赶到灾祸种下面去。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8ae85226cdb273bdc9b8629824c361a2a5bc35a92c124c6eae559cc985eb219e",
      "source_sha256": "5dac712f2ec7530febff20081fac64abe89c338bb9acbc01aa96118d91dceaf2",
      "translation": "明明是那家伙先挑衅的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ea9bd0c25514fbfe3436b1d1e3709d5a28ea88fb807f500cb7db35fa07691231",
      "source_sha256": "b745099b441792c0eb5d9835fbef0a178b10e8d3df9c15eef4e3c1000a0561e1",
      "translation": "你一激就怒，也有问题。克罗塞尔就是故意的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:15c6c899dc1c0a20a8233f5e0febca6fb375615ad5a1e21f780a478f4718b53f",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:af5868ce281cfd5a82016c512febf779c92ce7e103611afef459897465a4c689",
      "source_sha256": "5c3eb57c66a1d26c65c30bfd112d69aba6fe725e865ff5bee1ac508a50c9c7ec",
      "translation": "灾祸种，就是一种“灾难”。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:83215b8b4d7b40293692408e0279f298475d679573239624ba10b1ef81d33aab",
      "source_sha256": "30bfd2008fceb8d7dda39e09324a4cedcfc2739f08634b315a5645b172f4ec3e",
      "translation": "……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:32680ef5beb63e0bc6c4639f8d761c019ea51850080832ee80171109a8be1703",
      "source_sha256": "7b64d0af58bc2dd09d887d88db53cd215b06ac9f16bb29e06a35c2d33d3f791a",
      "translation": "灾祸种降下时，庄稼就难以生长，连环术也会失效，卡蒙德同样无法发挥作用。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:49fe1724c8ed8623cfb270907037f8a13f60e2aa2366a10cff49409d78dc7502",
      "source_sha256": "18d4058fa498fc529f71b964d41ad82f820ceeb7b2a7cf89372c371f174e1ac0",
      "translation": "也就是说，它会严重影响我们的日常生活。所以，人们才称它为“灾祸种”，意为灾难的种子。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dde4dd384b7d98ed14fcc0b7d5e2e60472130837a679aa3b3a2454b6b7b87e9f",
      "source_sha256": "c691a9d8b01e9107a3ec4e46c0d87c905c6dc7d14354cc24d2ae18c6cb53432a",
      "translation": "这种东西，是从什么时候开始降下的？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bf22431c9c31f248adfc1269e7744b5b9240ae81f5de369a2456aabcfa9c8f2e",
      "source_sha256": "a5c6983bc5eb3a0c388a9b400124d1049776030f5119f1eb27b00e239e627d90",
      "translation": "大概从3年前开始，就经常能看见了。正是在这次内战爆发前。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7b31847cc9d5e5e2352c08905977062662f326020139f2b207f85631679f9222",
      "source_sha256": "3faeffe2a053cf62e5e648a0cd55b5c3524ff03c5e33acd61da10bdb9c24cb5f",
      "translation": "根据记载，过去似乎也曾有过几次灾祸种降下的情况。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f3045ddf9d3bc15e2697aba5179878476b1889f04e891a74e9b6a20b308c0b1d",
      "source_sha256": "698816ca371c053cf7153c3d70460351b6dcbf92ba6acad1c055116d99e82ecb",
      "translation": "虽然还不清楚灾祸种的确切成因，但我想，或许与KAN有关。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d0701d78d9dfdb121e1aeae990c14b15a976e45d8c121bca7e815d21e4bec7cf",
      "source_sha256": "5fbf024399e0e5628aa99a722f232abbe1883bd1e79f7024ae3bceebd5d6662f",
      "translation": "灾祸种一旦降下，那一带的KAN就会消失。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:73568177641931635e27f646dab390d4eb962e83652e750f37c0badc69366476",
      "source_sha256": "9207b3bc6eab55b4d4d40276125ff0ecea68369319ac813e500ddf32e4e93181",
      "translation": "所以才会用不了连环术吗？灾祸种比我想象的还可怕啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b5b82b21db17a862b48f6a28799ef0a9e5af41073de78c7ba37e0ddd80cccd08",
      "source_sha256": "59ab6c4663213a26df926437dc420c1154273883dce3f37189316283638142e3",
      "translation": "是啊……还有一种说法，若经常淋到灾祸种，就会体力衰退，最终死亡。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bf699aee017300b772df8482b63a8fed11442dbe4aaefc0ca4303d06f18facfe",
      "source_sha256": "5e92bfd86d6c808c45da6f520995ed7dd90f4c75374b80227dfba7426835c0f4",
      "translation": "不过，还不知道是真是假。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:615fba7e33c0bc4197bb599cbb658816156039839df501155603547b5b3e58e0",
      "source_sha256": "40ab14305860763cd03038462fbc3aadb116d16fcdc395d1fc40c675e4e2b75e",
      "translation": "虽然说是灾难，却很美呢。风息岛从来没下过这个，我还是第一次见。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7640128d7b2e27df747577941d4071c1a03c29fb1a092ee4f9934c555a674d36",
      "source_sha256": "4fc71a6591593589efd55f21a8987add09ce20e5f63e9947a63334af6d423e61",
      "translation": "它往往会在大战前降下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ea48fa2120092f9053873ae6c89d26d8cce0f8480f4e8f62d9d4b146b72ea5e5",
      "source_sha256": "ac9907096d4248c7961ce05a352b347af071236c158fd125f84f5221c6f81176",
      "translation": "所以大家才会更加认定，灾祸种就是灾难吧。因为它会招来战争。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c98c41776e8fe9dd3c57d07bcdfdcb463f45278fdb7005a7030bdaf2eb6abca0",
      "source_sha256": "e502530f3efe5bcd2701b0366f73c428c62748384cf15a72035ef8931878b432",
      "translation": "我听说，150年前，也曾有一位贵族发动叛乱，让兰兹海姆陷入战争。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ecad05d727a8be418589b66ca0f4130ed10c72e37d6cca272e8e2fb60fa2be1d",
      "source_sha256": "0c79681bef540d3406ca79351ab98203afd608613defd36dcc19599319f22b12",
      "translation": "那场战争似乎被称作“鲁哈尔特内战”。据说当时开战前，也降下了灾祸种。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:23754a0e765138b72c0d2f75e89e529647098c0d287441b872f5e9d515261d6f",
      "source_sha256": "f59b10d6e3091212377659cbcdd8d3addb4ca12a0db8c4ceede22f538b703a45",
      "translation": "这次也是，修恩扎伊特发动战争前，灾祸种就像发出信号一样降下了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7ba8cb059112256f7b376ea72acdd44d42cf751fbe51a3e387585fdd938abee3",
      "source_sha256": "02d199356ff1e8c0482318a2c4d46ad15cce28d4756650c78a9eb50f8f6974b3",
      "translation": "或许，灾祸种就是自然对那些发动战争、破坏大地的人类，降下的惩罚吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fb9d41986c1eed87097955729c8685d9e56b526228515dbe17eef0e856b1f06b",
      "source_sha256": "28114f0ad9b5658037576cf6708e26cf11a1f63686f63e028859bc0fc2b350e6",
      "translation": "那么……没有办法让它停下来吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e710ef654e9df380c65a5b3298319e6455801b41239df79391b0441b349da871",
      "source_sha256": "beab49df9c55cbd41e4816a4f36791eab928e5f41163039c30537d30d1a4cfe6",
      "translation": "这个……还不知道。只有传说称，玛格纳卡尔塔能让灾祸种停止。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1231f065f2dee463ac161e2e1165bd346ac60da2c31a711578a851602477f9e5",
      "source_sha256": "c998838d99708a18e9e56fb42536dcc7563cf7cef66573f9849b8c9f98cc8f6c",
      "translation": "玛格纳卡尔塔……是说英雄斯特拉斯吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:60bd61e92638d906cef92c0811e46054c2ce2ff9c8467a310338e7d993ee9c93",
      "source_sha256": "93b0fa325ce94168e45419a0a74381746530ca8cc487fcaa40e34378dd53de0a",
      "translation": "是的。不过，玛格纳卡尔塔也有“超越卡尔塔的卡尔塔”之意，因为斯特拉斯正是那样的存在。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d4e04ccb6a242f6b657fffe95352bee190fdc9df39538af6473ca570d1cfa32",
      "source_sha256": "2976f3fc68453bcbb2ea7e2f6764b0733fd2725b602ad0dd655524bd98476bd2",
      "translation": "所以，拥有足以媲美斯特拉斯的强大KAN之人，也会被称为玛格纳卡尔塔。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c0d5cbaccbd3e73bb8b949d4a9bfce57c7cb71e722051dc4ccab1a6e23161adb",
      "source_sha256": "c641fe058d14d158f7ed17398a8f56a395df887ad313718376c9b14bbf4464ef",
      "translation": "但即便有玛格纳卡尔塔，不知道停止灾祸种的方法，恐怕也无济于事。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:72f9f8a89e24593c99ef0b7bf54f6bb2bba50b907d14ef3816f05b84e4b21f7a",
      "source_sha256": "457ef78c721407662b438768a1cf6baa4649d5c5dfa9a746e640a3e0eea3bc7f",
      "translation": "那不都是迷信吗？以前那些战争英雄，不也常被冠上玛格纳卡尔塔的称号？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:96f43a5d9eb76ecc1d21a1a893f243cd4300d3367d7835bf9be717992604d490",
      "source_sha256": "cead5409b56003fe5b05f1d1deef511e2e3b2620a7d2d736e2b4a306bcf598af",
      "translation": "那倒也是。不过，其中确实也有像斯特拉斯一样，实力强大的连环术师。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:46e955cba85ed87d10d9086ce01586d603f45438f7a5211a45854c09baf541cb",
      "source_sha256": "1a2c4d0efe3b1ac795032ad6fa621d0e310f79a020ee5a853a99f4cd5efe2dbc",
      "translation": "灾祸种还是不停啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ffeab7c41a376ab11da35cfcfa57ee33b987b1044e56b10d9445df29e69862cd",
      "source_sha256": "6ebebeff039e5fc8f6a564aa97516f34385607da567e2f22dde794df1e5f06a6",
      "translation": "这可麻烦了，难道只能一直等下去？我们连应急口粮和水都没有。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e4e115f18b99d2a63ac9df4e76842c1d6c9cc026da4a8b3372e61b4ce8a7b663",
      "source_sha256": "a360bfd2c425c5d162ee7c3496b43c36b7a8ab73d9da1fa6db1056dc9eb0e3fc",
      "translation": "是啊，喝了沾到灾祸种的水，也会暂时用不了连环术，真让人头疼。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:156fe019d65444793f6f5fc53133d7f6cc20da487c5d7ef13290c2e1cae4e69f",
      "source_sha256": "aa0fa6065168dc68a696fbb2d15f693801c2e678278ef6261e9eeb9a519ae68c",
      "translation": "反正稍微淋到一点灾祸种，也不会就此丧命。不如直接去柯塔马雷吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:660e6583c55d0499cd7a892408c6913e17ae6f8d563893329ad5b193e98fba81",
      "source_sha256": "35af16cf522a6d40765b85be3387e79667f7b363683811a1a73f58e613198524",
      "translation": "可是，偏偏在这种时候去柯塔马雷，总觉得会给人留下坏印象。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9c91d41ea9bb6816afc99d53cc7399dbd0efdf3d76c639a883d590366d82df41",
      "source_sha256": "a3a9aa169402b71f1ccd9462cc55aec59e83ace6be6a698fb297e859964d32f1",
      "translation": "马雷族恐怕认为，灾祸种就是内战招来的……不会欢迎我们吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6d0aa1874732f69bd061320d2d32355b0a2faca09535b97951445f0d22a82337",
      "source_sha256": "21dec5b7c651d2446571aa7ce7ef34f3ae54bb5f60b6ada3074ed14b9ddc7d4e",
      "translation": "马雷族？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c144f61b9e0d4e1db1c0fc943c67d3a7b72924c019da392eeef196bbe5501a03",
      "source_sha256": "92b3cbafd00902f9bddf464ca618dfc6caf79b2c6cb4232641ceaaece6cd75d7",
      "translation": "你是从别的世界来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3f2fe87f8cfba0636bc67d279c01f42400be09c1eacebb934f12eb9b31b552c2",
      "source_sha256": "9a2c5722899fddaa5f98fdb173654fcc7f489666449c9fe89769138d951193bf",
      "translation": "我又没问你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5647d4bf8540b521254b20bbbb95195b05afbbc92a0a521af361226c91393893",
      "source_sha256": "1ad3c623c4df054fc589a8ae9fa6aa8abe14f0e77e9ffba762ea1c86dc59c8a8",
      "translation": "马雷族，是居住在柯塔马雷的种族。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3b3625323d1d25f2598b0e8656a76dcb7aa42c42d016da325407298d1c16fdb2",
      "source_sha256": "2fcaf33bfc81da3a624f971284d050e7cd347336a99a8d95d754b7b2d1b814fa",
      "translation": "不过，他们的外貌和人类很相似，你应该感觉不到太大差别，几乎难以分辨。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4643b682cb03a692a0bd67dc8098f873f995aaf65deb6e1871f3f2111d61e547",
      "source_sha256": "b71afaf191b2a607338ccd79dc07894552f04a3b28fb8588c77d79f32768e084",
      "translation": "只是，马雷族比人类成长得快，10年左右就能成年。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:185d1a44feac507f3ea98e78c24729ab1960f0207ac1739a6ba59dd97181d478",
      "source_sha256": "31fcb9784535f25c56d537047dcd4a242b7e1e83c1e12524cae2d656b1a2109d",
      "translation": "啊，真神奇。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1f31afd976c6737504bc733f9ca03e11d3435591b724b0e5e93adb5b1dceec38",
      "source_sha256": "e2d737ff4e74b80d9df4e17ffeb3ae61f60bc2f5bfb2cf58f0cfa1f0ad58ce3d",
      "translation": "马雷族虽然只有40年左右的寿命，却能一直保持年轻，直到生命终结。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:219126c7503735b141f6ae9d9d78582922e7f84c9d03f7ccb246abd7dc76381b",
      "source_sha256": "bc108780e2e0415d0295635dd11a24124ad6b374b9dc2fb596fb44e39f855b39",
      "translation": "应该吧，马雷族不喜欢争斗。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1b092bef6a55aa8b2657161032795bc943d099996b437c8421061cfff502fe2e",
      "source_sha256": "3901fe80a23a582daad0f9a1ba06ff45d1be7d8ccacc00873255cbc3b40064ca",
      "translation": "那不就得隐瞒我们是南部军的身份，再进去吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ea4356ddc6b60008a20a4402eebc7e2a34dfbe841ab8a5cd8a30e38364fd5bb9",
      "source_sha256": "f1fc0848f29266817701727e941abba9c8b513a35456fefff16807acd81f865e",
      "translation": "我们是来向马雷族提议结盟的，还是堂堂正正地表明身份，再进去比较好吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:58f89d4e0f71aadc3009b0767003af1cf3d1431e91c723f4ee7239b2d1f9ce24",
      "source_sha256": "25f9515db716e57fefbe6563127f8c8ced6b07f37a2630c9710cb1b7846e4c30",
      "translation": "可那样立刻就会吃闭门羹。偏偏还下着灾祸种，要是被赶到外面，可就麻烦了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:032c976fe0b007053f79a941e4be09cdb20dd62a9fe180dc530ebfe3df56871f",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f012b0d791637abd736048826f457d2e95ec606830c5d26a28d34dd3b4154d4b",
      "source_sha256": "8e79a5540602c3d7c49039e29498e3eb46264df754d61972414daeb7ef38b85b",
      "translation": "没办法。虽然不太情愿，或许还是别表明身份为好。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:38f7e024cb4abc6f36caf733c14327b1ac8df61c81717c1eb7333c09a58ac99f",
      "source_sha256": "f20101ae2999e26be48da1eebcceff90bc8330b59ee0a4e1381605ad41a02b43",
      "translation": "洁菲，你觉得该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bc6159ecfe2151f090fce713d806bba12a48a9178839cafae290dbcbd9fb1a27",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:611a56398b32155cca8249b096c4fb988fb592d7a2b5864e0f15b05523e01868",
      "source_sha256": "306d9987bd7005a8537859f8af4b68994cf5534d5da57392d80d8520dc81518b",
      "translation": "虽然不想欺骗马雷族，但我们必须见到族长……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:16617fa7f294e39558926343dbf3f3c5a9b05e56724ba07661d0acb625ccb13c",
      "source_sha256": "ab715721fb864338f6c8c80a2815a8c9efbdd9b72f8becbff9137f85f0985049",
      "translation": "继续这样待着，什么也解决不了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:003fb81aa947f5d1016748cd09960fbbc039da16faa8a59dfd17290732a77378",
      "source_sha256": "8e02bad2441ae517b7ae1f1c6ea72d53c2ca533fd7cca504a9ccaefeb0817944",
      "translation": "唉，先解决眼前的燃眉之急吧。虽然无奈，也只能演一场戏了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:571cfe6c94286c73bf55bd84d80f5596bad6f8a56c2cffcf89f1ee86db2076c7",
      "source_sha256": "24194223b551ad3be329ab63e2c49539034bdddc0f55ec75d86598c4c06699e1",
      "translation": "灾祸种似乎也小了一些，我们出发吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8073b71af8196f3edb910e7e768b797da9b433b3f9ae16d08aca223152734ba9",
      "source_sha256": "dddbc144e5bea99c77c84f0bd58ecb696e6e6685ccd466def53f051e8704ea21",
      "translation": "总算停了，连环术也用不了，真快把我憋死了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ba19941bedb5ad8ac0ea2827e906376a6e7fcd353b259fc379a4ceb800543a8c",
      "source_sha256": "fb1711ca0bec4d83f640797402087b8bd908b2aca3bbb69add687eea58348a74",
      "translation": "太好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f126aa55c9c4c9f2de37e3ad0ab90524bcb32a0cf3e003f75c99523faedd9880",
      "source_sha256": "0e8c6f06694035cafb76ab25c41929ade7a1c40cc05b7318b6384a0b6f6863b2",
      "translation": "马上就到柯塔马雷了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:14163d4253da0052e6a338d63cdd412e79d98cd755972341a5acd9b3d0b12ac5",
      "source_sha256": "f39da3796c808f8271064aa6f04c274334e9d54a9710df246808a31fd3626ba3",
      "translation": "说起来，来到这里后，库布就没反应了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ed432bbad058fe5ba4b31cf096249d750f8af16eeeaecdc35efe72bec0cb50aa",
      "source_sha256": "f2a71db7e320376c1e2971b572ea384304b47cd3dbc72c0328d16aa1fc6791b9",
      "translation": "总司令部那些家伙，一定正为公主的安危担心得不得了吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:720c0e297b9ff44c1518cf1bd2caf77da26ce5022fc40d90ce644f439f55bcc2",
      "source_sha256": "47ba56e948d07aa47d9838cef09e821e2671fc23dd8375350d03d4aff31085fa",
      "translation": "现在也没办法，只能之后再报告情况。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9f4c6a42041827c20ca5eed7ccff1c0214f8c57525a6d77c500234551239a22a",
      "source_sha256": "0600efd9e10ad3da4de2921fcad00c33b22bd7a63346d7fb9d9ad3f85c86aa49",
      "translation": "有股很好闻的香气……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2859efe3649e96f56e391aa66166a782bab59370cae672e6931cd790d95328dc",
      "source_sha256": "b28d2bacc167f3dc8f894b7727822c14b443649afb3685abe56405a6b39bb608",
      "translation": "马雷族有着丰富的药草知识。听说，他们会在村里焚香，香料是用上好的药草调配而成。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9139df1717dbd6846e03e61951728034f692772c9c92185ede3656fa6c73d9c1",
      "source_sha256": "51b01b618e3c8b7a70e8607929c6d43331ba2dbc07737759e955c26590e6fa00",
      "translation": "喂……那几个怎么看都像守卫的家伙，正盯着我们呢？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8b453d00b512c7bce75cdedf03908cd885ac0594b5cba6ef84897041592f0673",
      "source_sha256": "53e55c2db245de5dbff6d71d805314bb974ade919b91daf064541c0a09c34d50",
      "translation": "你们是人类吧！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:46fe794b1de0b7733d6ad340d3eb8ac82c5fb2652c07b7203d160ca8f0eb18f6",
      "source_sha256": "0bf8a5e2eaeb42d57c7bedb0e47710911646d1e5b0a9f253d3b654b6eaea4bb6",
      "translation": "不许再靠近，我们不和人类接触。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:af5161a42e4f5ffd16258fe840b6d19a9ea0a619e37fc661bc55409f1c54b6cd",
      "source_sha256": "8139102e6cb7cf0eb6839c01a62a975352804614bc616c3f0085e130f47b775f",
      "translation": "总之，我绝对不想在战场上碰见他们。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b0b7824c32f20fa0db58b4a61cb2e4056f64b03a0e92f0d96d33f9d36e74a56e",
      "source_sha256": "38be8c3df4ab2fa4b45fbafc295a4fa2f04e7518cf55c99850833c536e4d24f2",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特的部下里，有个叫[克蕾尔]的女人，被称作梦魇魔女。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d05ce533d4946e34ae049467d873c8ffbe99a4575b4a0610f996af435862df0",
      "source_sha256": "6f60b2adc784d7a012e2629ee6108860b03eaf026e74cd09b90c6d3062776386",
      "translation": "她美貌非凡，听说修恩扎伊特收她为养女，从小抚养长大。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8cef24fe2b1419c14698ea38d7f17d4d1423f75ee3344b0c41f092ac8ba3e03e",
      "source_sha256": "7a9310b3d90250792c4f249ad585cc5f813ea60178f987cab02e36684868bbeb",
      "translation": "也有人说，她其实是修恩扎伊特秘密的恋人。是真的吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c946fe11b05ec4493c59149df6c87a9d1f0ae82e811bd65a2b3c5693353fd9b2",
      "source_sha256": "a47546dc909ba9ae342c416748638e7411057d1797538b680c0a7b17a20b785f",
      "translation": "公主身边原本总有个叫[露]的护卫，最近却不见了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:26b004919f153564d6877097faac1f4f89463201246bdd64104659d6ee91911f",
      "source_sha256": "6f1d5aa7fe8136486d1e484dc077dfd3d20b4e60bbfeb02fd05ce43700bcea09",
      "translation": "虽然是个模样可爱的女孩，但她的实力，南部军里人人都认可。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3760ac40eaa0ef255b2820b5777eaf8b973c6e6783277bf306e8222c96401a08",
      "source_sha256": "518251f904cc1ee2f5757627debe4de473c65a4a12af014546a5576e20ccd4b6",
      "translation": "难道正在执行什么绝密任务？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c91af9d3f3b51013f67c627a99eecc0fc672a71ba98c10a2339e4e1ea66d2278",
      "source_sha256": "a93fea14067d93ed08346c938a4a2214a84b2641571c543614a704aa4b8c57ce",
      "translation": "这里是南部军总司令部。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2cf8b0de1464cb718844c1d66e6fd2f318e0d3ee693f41fbdaac0c2d3b1f3ffd",
      "source_sha256": "57723716e153f55daf51e267bed11f997ca4d0d080af8c463fccce2729be4a3a",
      "translation": "南部军的干部们，就在这里开会、制定作战计划。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b475f26bd1ea83bd8cd4f51e8dbe5b6c292e2729d8c522ebfcb26c0239d5741b",
      "source_sha256": "aa4f736d48ded8ebc75851cf7ab021727a37cca155b1ec48b9e5744d473eff6e",
      "translation": "一般来说，南部军的正规军负责城镇警备，佣兵则大多在最前线作战。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8c29ad21e69c5d23f9fd8b6faf60956ffbd8abaa55d5e023c8cc0d447445ca63",
      "source_sha256": "7364f78586f393d5e6abd3ca061ea9df981a8b9f2d654262dfee17b5a41e5067",
      "translation": "总司令部的建筑很气派吧？原本是贵族宅邸，后来改成了南部军总司令部。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:85d46d61d883c8da8ff102dbef42a1f6164713f9673b5871b83e701ad34be4dd",
      "source_sha256": "3cad16fb02c53ad36cb5450d5e33daf185b1c6201e2b3fb0b28347d2f6edb505",
      "translation": "阿巴泽特是兰兹海姆的第2首都，不过现在已经成了南部军的据点。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d469cde59492f590b835010f8a83b4b2004903762a08150376d8a135ad6ac172",
      "source_sha256": "4697ba6b590309db52c30885d8988e3f5648717f1716c607a928369faad31883",
      "translation": "听说又在老狐峡谷吃了败仗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ec1c68c632a87b34757d6afffed154cabd019698ecf5bdf7e1fc1054ecdb88cb",
      "source_sha256": "3f67401d7877c98dd47aeba9612cfc45b367382ae47b63e1898bd49a49e3d860",
      "translation": "战争真是让人受够了，赶紧结束吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1dfe1bf049d5030e873455b7379b0aeda7f1613be1c2800069fd5a2687fa00c8",
      "source_sha256": "4a01de41579c916dd2a0ab8e4cadf52b79ff23d97e1536e034efebfd51bbff68",
      "translation": "这个房间是总司令部的会议室。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c51487aebbc5494f232b5fc17bc762fa4d3ce327bfbf2826fc312c3c3f25c784",
      "source_sha256": "c90cf661e76401e16208732cda5f291403284cbe99365e38ab81bb04feb3beeb",
      "translation": "南部军就在这间会议室里，聚集起来商议作战。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1600734240798393c5c1bb840d752142d14d79b7908ca42d0e191b06c926b3a5",
      "source_sha256": "d9f19f91fb4072e5da7126c0963fbe665f8b0de6acda04720fa7451c592ee8e5",
      "translation": "亚历克斯大人真了不起。他救出了遭到幽禁的公主，还组建了南部军。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8a3c9fa9ec25607267aa124f11768eaf5b4a864fb5e27273bb5487f3d2bb9a12",
      "source_sha256": "5f6fa2440f856f63ea42a55259597eee7d0e76b6bf7153f7d60e61803baed8d4",
      "translation": "公主指挥的反哨兵部队，似乎一直没能发挥什么作用。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8ea5ab08f1b10c8b90e649ee40a41c389f50728a28744e24e837d07c474d7651",
      "source_sha256": "d0d119a9ed6d3b7e9aaffdbb0a356f572ef2c850d9521e9d3c5ac3725d639da6",
      "translation": "也说明哨兵确实很难对付吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1721b7c85ff9059606d1b202965f7da008ab6094544ddaff8fdb8f92c1a3f5bd",
      "source_sha256": "4a726768f4b3b1687b9c324bec39c2214abafc570b6d5f94bb0d12469637bebd",
      "translation": "劳德司令官是位了不起的人，既认真负责，又满怀爱国之心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:83daf3fcc30ab02ab5359ee0fb83adf7705a517d79a52ffa3837d6db609e17b7",
      "source_sha256": "8942fa6157e0ff3775cb85b24c02ab897a596735c88c94f68e7266bb832066b0",
      "translation": "精华提取"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ecce767110d11610f891d65d7fbcf6acc45cd9478d52a0dab23dbc331d2d17a6",
      "source_sha256": "77621c2cdefea393f616e34b0f6b4fef60ed8382e5dc1e9c406fa6eb61a74a2d",
      "translation": "使用洁菲的固有技[精华提取]，从怪物身上\\n提取卡蒙德\\n[精华提取]在怪物濒死时，有一定概率发动\\n使用精华提取时，必须让洁菲担任队长"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:03a185809df77689d88cc71a547bb13c4d1eae24d2bdce4e7e45409ec6d4557c",
      "source_sha256": "a0f6d927deaf743a12fdbedd75d7a38cd11e461e92405ed57216641b4a8cc7f4",
      "translation": "卡蒙德可以像这样开采获得，不过，还有一种更轻松的方法，叫作[精华提取]。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a9f00ff89427d8865c35e1b844683bb8156e0f9caca6dfd0a640822d685c4953",
      "source_sha256": "4e14452f314216844128abfe93d6421aacecdd00f003e9e254117afe12d6d108",
      "translation": "你知道，怪物也是体内藏有卡蒙德的生物吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d214e18c37084a4e9a2978552914cec545aaf7b6a59361cd8873928471fbba13",
      "source_sha256": "1f810a5238d9989394e7f68537f11314ac0420ae9972b2a3aa674f0bb54a07ba",
      "translation": "那就是把它体内的卡蒙德取出来的技术。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:17b7a57909f3831255871f04760e4d15743920db8ce3d81e440f6e96ea27d75f",
      "source_sha256": "afd59336cecec8647cdb56e39409a8cbec067d34fcb6c49d5fb69a7967ae49e6",
      "translation": "但也不是随时都行，得等到怪物陷入濒死状态，才有可能。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5d69a5792592f87e4aad214d70ad1c8479ad8d65a283f2b28fab779e58d48bae",
      "source_sha256": "9b5e709e221574b9fd322387ee241fba8934b8fed82adac1233cc92c7a47a8bc",
      "translation": "不过，精华提取似乎也不是每次都能成功……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:caf08acb03240b76bd5e1fdf3afcdb649bcde6d7842134eed1370429fdedc315",
      "source_sha256": "57eef504e7dfa91f32f4a290c96d7ea3881231b4d5602a9c411582d22daed0c9",
      "translation": "听说只有少数连环术师能做到，不过，蕾洁菲尔妲公主就可以。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e744a4d3257e9f8534853bb0ef0590e17ee3f0ec2883b89372b8713bc8ef74d4",
      "source_sha256": "3ad594ca32d13e29a5a76d32366386aeebf00d34cdc3c42e865dcb2094cf62fa",
      "translation": "试着对附近的怪物用一用，取出一颗卡蒙德吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:96d8652f0075ba95a41f8ef756d8c26608b56d3a84ee01b6888b59f8f04ff644",
      "source_sha256": "57fbf94caf27715f3116a419063b56bee11bd89556d30574947aeb659a843ceb",
      "translation": "虽然是我让你试试，但说真的，实在让人羡慕。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:eb11fe1f2721937ee9ae3b9c26f6565a6c0fdfc6ba79549e1572619084ec25a9",
      "source_sha256": "98cbaadddf910826141c77449f371b0f26c107af053c52ab0166cfb48271a4ae",
      "translation": "我要是有那种能力，赚钱可就轻松多了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:42483f7ee3176d2c8826f2e26bc6828d8b146cfb75a4003b4fa8cbac7ab98f69",
      "source_sha256": "4c83e5682cb1fb172a9ecba3f1a6a4ae38f8d1147c19c30cbac02914cb9161fe",
      "translation": "不过，没本事打倒怪物的话，还是不行吧……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2f9618cd6d7b990ad5abd518991fe2f20d1c9aa28e49cbd06750c32f053e8bb6",
      "source_sha256": "0e79bcc24f9ff02b4f9871dbb4f3057a36f0a4fb7b5430821b8f3dd85c534590",
      "translation": "不愿意？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f3553d2a0090bbee9acdccf74ff5506771a302be6209ad79762eb50cde4f1880",
      "source_sha256": "23f39f56222c22d96728f97e32925ef0b6eb9dbf80c35529b936028e144ddd2d",
      "translation": "真是的……换作是我，一定会拼命使用，轻轻松松赚大钱。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4daf6901a9791f0db71982395e96d7e682753f7655a438d90ede03dd6fe76289",
      "source_sha256": "7d157c549cf7070d3e74333f5fc8f00b7e25235cd9f06eb3468501e9e0f054d1",
      "translation": "怪物陷入濒死状态后，就能用公主的精华提取，获得卡蒙德！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8de546faa454333933413daa41533d217a1579d106a1683c5feec2f23921b5f5",
      "source_sha256": "c47a9cc8e7374f65707ac615a79184b0afd6b2add1c44d57a0f312b043abcd13",
      "translation": "哎呀……真是让人羡慕的能力。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ac3ba5982cd1086af18bbb2726bc324ca290aeb0132414af3e507018ec7ae81f",
      "source_sha256": "330dc8d3a522be198e8d45e26b4b5ec57cda0d0381ae59e06db01c14b1088118",
      "translation": "以后遇到各种怪物，也继续试着使用吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5c455c0ad60dc7c378aa0f2892dc92fd91073211e1333a4b873c9152f7c20076",
      "source_sha256": "5ae510dcaaba214c08ebe9dad27099bf4134de36431fea3c5068668664b35c0c",
      "translation": "说不定能得到特殊卡蒙德呢，那可是能卖个好价钱的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a0edfd5edb62b25655599b7013b4c7e99f7d0e1fb289119ff60f261de3ef870f",
      "source_sha256": "a15e5d9e6aea4f7f10e40c4088f22fabe2d3c7c9e45ff908398421f20102ad6e",
      "translation": "Quest: 精华提取成功！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c4075f6659173b35ce7871a5dd74d88be515b3aa2972541f92b34a8c921a9ec6",
      "source_sha256": "8942fa6157e0ff3775cb85b24c02ab897a596735c88c94f68e7266bb832066b0",
      "translation": "精华提取"
    }
  ]
}
